 Recent major new features
 ---------------------------
 
+Moss Terminal AI integration [0.48, fork]
+~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
+
+This fork embeds the Moss AI engine directly in the terminal process. Type
+``》question`` at any shell prompt and the engine answers inline, with full
+awareness of the commands and output on your screen (captured per window via
+OSC 133 semantic zones). No daemon, no sockets; the engine is a Rust cdylib
+loaded lazily, and every hook is a no-op when it is absent. Set
+``MOSS_ENABLED=0`` at build time for a vanilla kitty.
+
